---
title: "Diesel Truck Electrical Systems"
code: "DSL-143"
category: "diesel"
credits: "4"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Studies the theory and operation of various truck and tractor electrical systems. Covers preheating, starting, generating, and lighting systems. Uses modern test equipment for measurement, adjustment, and troubleshooting. Lecture 2 hours per week. Laboratory 4 hours. Total 6 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
